			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## 1.1.0 - 2026-08-30\n\n- Fixed flight-planner terrain distortion by using an aspect-correct map projection and scale bar.\n- Cached terrain during pan and zoom operations and reduced redundant terrain sampling.\n- Added the Route Chart for carrying a tower route to another tower.\n- Added the Tower Connector and persistent same-dimension tower networks.\n- Connected powered towers now share coverage, public routes, dispatch reach, and automatic-support capability.\n- Added automated tests for map projection, route persistence, and tower-network topology/persistence."
		},
