			"notes": "## English\n\n### Highlights\n- Fixed inconsistent rendering layers and background blur affecting the Flight Planner map, labels, and vanilla widgets.\n- Changed the default Flight Planner key from `P` to `.` and moved HUD notifications to avoid overlapping Immersive Aircraft prompts.\n- Fixed an issue where the biplane autopilot could not take off correctly from the ground.\n- Added pitch dead zones, vertical-speed damping, and continuous stall protection to reduce vertical oscillation in flight.\n- Removed duplicate tower route recommendations while retaining the newest valid offer.\n\n### Compatibility\n- Minecraft 1.21.1\n- NeoForge 21.1.133 or later\n- Requires Immersive Aircraft\n\n## 中文\n\n### 主要更新\n- 修复飞行规划器中地图、文字与原版控件渲染层级不一致及画面虚化问题。\n- 飞行规划器默认按键由 `P` 改为 `.`，并调整 HUD 提示位置以避免与 Immersive Aircraft 提示重叠。\n- 修复双翼机自动驾驶在地面无法正常起飞的问题。\n- 加入俯仰死区、垂直速度阻尼与连续失速保护，减少飞行中的上下抖动。\n- 去除重复的塔台航路推荐，并保留最新有效推荐。\n\n### 兼容性\n- Minecraft 1.21.1\n- NeoForge 21.1.133 或更高版本\n- 需要 Immersive Aircraft\n\n## Integrity / 文件校验\n\nSHA-256: `7B404785BF775845F720AA44BD55E08EB99CAF0F565D78A1B2F83FE9F9A6CFA2`"
		},
